# Rebuildable pictures and the self-contained preview page. The originals in img/ can be fetched again from the
# Commons pages in img/credits.json (which IS kept); faces.py remakes arts/, faces/ and lines/ from them; build.mjs
# remakes personality.html. The site keeps its own committed copies in site/public/img/personality/, and
# site/scripts/build-personality-data.mjs falls back to those when these are absent (as on Vercel).
img/*.jpg
small/
alt/
arts/
faces/
lines/
personality.html
contact-preview.jpg
